座位區「給小孩接尿」</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:22:16.291275+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1969,"images":14,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:00:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:38:54.580662+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:37.515969+00:00","content_hash":"ea93b18b600695de5210959c1e695f532a2c29ee832bebb063a5d135872dff81","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}